P10[Access Point 10]\n    end\n\n    CoreSW --- AbtSW1\n    CoreSW --- AbtS=
W2\n    CoreSW --- AbtSW3\n    CoreSW --- AbtSW4\n    CoreSW --- AbtSW5\n  =
  CoreSW --- AbtSW24\n    CoreSW --- Server1\n    CoreSW --- Server2\n    C=
oreSW --- Server3\n    CoreSW --- Server4\n    CoreSW --- Server5\n    Core=
